{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfpgLAsTCxsc3shcWuDN8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Discount Approval Decision: DR-9105\n\n## Analysis\n\n### 1. The Request\n- **Request ID**: DR-9105\n- **Customer (CRM)**: Acme Industrial Supply Co. (CRM-2091)\n- **Product SKU**: NS-500\n- **Requested discount**: 15.0%\n- **Date**: 2026-09-23\n- **Requestor**: Sarah Chen (Enterprise Account Executive)\n- **Basis claimed**: \"Contract pricing per Acme Master Supply Agreement\"\n\n### 2. The Customer Problem\n\nThe request is for **Acme Industrial Supply Co.** (CRM-2091, Standard tier, Akron, OH; ERP customer C-1044).\n\nThe contract cited—the **Acme Master Supply Agreement (ACME-MFG-2025)**—is with **Acme Mfg. Holdings** (CRM-2048, Strategic tier, Milwaukee, WI; ERP customer C-1001).\n\nThe support schedule confirms the distinction:\n> \"Acme Industrial Supply Co. is a different company and is not covered.\"\n\nThese are legally distinct entities at different locations with different CRM account IDs, ERP customer IDs, and account tiers.\n\n### 3. The Product\nSKU NS-500 (NS-500 Industrial Controller), list price $250,000. ✓\n\n### 4. Active Contract\nNo active contract exists for Acme Industrial Supply Co. on 2026-09-23. The Acme Master Supply Agreement is with a different customer.\n\n### 5. Pricing Exception\nNo pricing exception covers Acme Industrial Supply Co. for this product on this date. Exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15 applies only to Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048), a different customer.\n\n### 6. Policy\nPricing Policy 2026 applies (effective 2026-01-01 to 2026-12-31).\n\n### 7. Requestor's Authority\nUnder Pricing Policy 2026, Enterprise Account Executives may approve discounts up to 10%. Sarah Chen's authority is capped at 10%.\n\n### 8. Required Approver\nA 15% discount exceeds the requestor's authority and would require VP Sales (Michael Torres) approval—if eligibility were established.\n\n## Decision\n\n**REVIEW_REQUIRED**\n\nThe request relies on the Acme Master Supply Agreement as its commercial basis for the 15% discount. However, that agreement applies exclusively to Acme Mfg. Holdings, not to Acme Industrial Supply Co. These are distinct legal entities explicitly identified as separate in the organization's records. Special terms do not transfer between customers.\n\n**No special terms covering Acme Industrial Supply Co. (CRM-2091) for this product and date are in evidence.** Before this request can proceed, commercial review must establish whether Acme Industrial Supply Co. has its own contractual basis for the 15% discount on NS-500, or whether the customer identification in the request is incorrect.\n\nNote: A separate but identically structured request for the same product and discount (DR-9001) is correctly framed for Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048), the actual party to the Acme Master Supply Agreement.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"REVIEW_REQUIRED\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"DR-9105\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Industrial Supply Co. (CRM-2091)\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-500\",\n    \"requested_discount\": \"15.0%\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"sarah.chen@northstar.example\",\n    \"basis\": \"contract_exception\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"not_covered\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": null,\n    \"basis\": \"The Acme Master Supply Agreement cited in the request applies to Acme Mfg. Holdings (CRM-2048, ERP C-1001), not Acme Industrial Supply Co. (CRM-2091, ERP C-1044). These are distinct legal entities. No contract or exception covering Acme Industrial Supply Co. for NS-500 discounts is in evidence.\"\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"Pricing Policy 2026\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": \"10%\",\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"VP Sales (if eligibility were established)\",\n    \"approver\": \"Michael Torres\"\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"documents/acme_master_supply_agreement.md — applies to Acme Mfg. Holdings (C-1001), not Acme Industrial Supply Co. (C-1044)\",\n    \"documents/acme_pricing_exception.md — exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15 is for Acme Manufacturing, not Acme Industrial Supply Co.\",\n    \"documents/acme_support_schedule_c.md — explicitly states 'Acme Industrial Supply Co. is a different company and is not covered'\",\n    \"structured/crm_accounts.csv — CRM-2048 (Acme Manufacturing, Milwaukee, WI) and CRM-2091 (Acme Industrial Supply Co., Akron, OH) are separate accounts\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [\n    \"Contract or pricing exception establishing Acme Industrial Supply Co. (CRM-2091) eligibility for 15% NS-500 discount\"\n  ],\n  \"conditions\": [\n    {\n      \"what\": \"Commercial review: confirm whether Acme Industrial Supply Co. (CRM-2091) has a separate contract or exception permitting 15% NS-500 discount, or whether the customer in this request should be corrected to Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048)\",\n      \"who\": \"Deal Desk or Sales leadership\",\n      \"blocking\": true\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":25266,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":25266},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"321c19d6-c843-4eb5-be49-b55526946508","uuid":"be271979-0c14-4b2a-b696-40871bf2dbad","timestamp":"2026-10-08T11:19:59.353Z","request_id":"req_011CfpgLAfYb6BnjeSZJM6Qv"}
